  "notes": [
    "Four model requests were dispatched. Three returned, were accounted and produced committed commands totaling 21429 returned tokens. The fourth exceeded its declared generation read timeout; it has no returned usage. Do not describe this as four fully accounted responses or estimate its missing tokens from server progress logs.",
    "Two carpenter-workshop BUILD commands were rejected, first for stale pathfinding cache and then an occupied footprint. The intervening WAIT was accepted. All 1000 native elapsed ticks were explicitly requested by the model. No construction or resource acquisition completed; population stayed seven, food 45, drink 60 and wood three.",
    "The campaign stopped at an inference-transport failure before its first scheduled cursor-8 checkpoint. Zero periodic snapshots were captured; the periodic native-save path is not accepted by this attempt. There is no resumable final campaign checkpoint.",
    "The final paused native state at year 30, tick 20309 was captured separately as forensic evidence: 127 regular files, 8621334 bytes, independently inventory-verified. It is not an agent/trace/usage checkpoint and does not authorize automatic replay or continuation.",
    "All three committed generation bodies, current native facts, control references and measured prompt-token counts were verified. Every returned response included server-separated reasoning, retained privately and included in the reported completion usage.",
    "This fresh campaign started from the original digest-bound save, not a prior model checkpoint or scripted fixture. Gameplay instructions, model weights, sampling, output tokens and context were unchanged from the short thinking condition; campaign duration and budgets differed. This is not a model ranking or causal ablation.",
    "The isolated native game, temporary model server, local listener and reverse tunnel were independently verified stopped. Production services, revision and original paused calendar remained unchanged. No VM was created and no hosted model API was called.",
    "Zero metered model API charges do not establish zero hardware, electricity or existing-host costs. Operating costs remain unmeasured and one dispatch lacks returned token usage.",
    "The separately declared long-v2 condition changes only the generation read timeout from 180 to 600 seconds. It has no gameplay evidence in this bundle and must start a new campaign from the original save.",
    "Only bounded projections, aggregate diagnostics and digests are public. Raw model reasoning, responses, prompts, observations, memory, command parameters, runtime paths, weights and game saves remain private."
